## .NET build artifacts - must not be copied into the image;
## they contain Windows-absolute-path restore state that breaks
## dotnet publish inside the Linux build stage.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user

## VCS / editor
.git/
.gitignore
.idea/
.vscode/

## Docs and evidence (not needed inside the image)
*.md
evidencias/
k8s/
